# ── generated, but COMMITTED on purpose ──────────────────────────────────────
# internal/store/gen/, docs/openapi.json and web/src/api/schema.d.ts are
# generated AND tracked: Principle 10 requires CI to diff them so a schema drift
# is a build failure rather than a runtime surprise. Do not add them here.

